        <semantic:textAnnotation id="_b02af085-848f-4428-ba58-c33e9d37f7a7">
            <semantic:text>In theory, you should wait until this condition is true, but how many of you have witness those who jump boarding zones?</semantic:text>
        </semantic:textAnnotation>
        <semantic:textAnnotation id="_ef71854e-c9de-486d-8b30-b37b446a3ad3">
            <semantic:text>The good news, I have experienced with some Airlines (e.g., AA, Delta) recently decline boarding to passengers who are not in appropriate boarding zone.</semantic:text>
        </semantic:textAnnotation>
        <semantic:association id="_be58d643-5fcf-4b7e-9b48-9e0722c54d74" triso:readOnly="false" sourceRef="_ea0cce53-18d0-49ce-bfb1-7e21b79edcfe" targetRef="_b02af085-848f-4428-ba58-c33e9d37f7a7" associationDirection="None"/>
